me:de} a tenu jusqu'au bout. Les positions moyennes ne disent pas tout, mais elles disent qui occupait le terrain."},"en":{"lead":"On paper, {T:home:sub} lined up in a 4-2-3-1. On the pitch, in possession, it looked more like a 3-4-3. {T:away:sub} announced a 4-2-3-1 and attacked in a 3-4-3: a team sheet is a starting point, not a contract.","keys":["{T:home:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-4-3 with the ball, 4-4-2 without.","{T:away:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-4-3 with the ball, 3-3-3-1 without.","{T:home:sub} played wide: 52% of touches in the two outer lanes.","{T:home:sub} camped in the opponent's half: 30% of touches in the final third.","{T:away:sub} played wide: 51% of touches in the two outer lanes."],"impact":"{T:home:pos} plan held to the end. Average positions do not say everything, but they say who owned the space."}},"s3":{"fr":{"lead":"Pressing à armes égales : 13,8 et 15,2 de PPDA, personne n'a vraiment étouffé l'autre.","keys":["Réaction à la perte comparable : 23 % et 28 % des ballons perdus récupérés en moins de 5 s.","15 récupérations hautes pour {T:away:sub} (ballons perdus par l'adversaire dans ses 35 derniers mètres) : autant de départs d'actions à deux pas du but."],"impact":"Le pressing n'a pas fait la différence : il faut chercher ailleurs, dans les surfaces."},"en":{"lead":"Even pressing: a PPDA of 13.8 and 15.2, nobody really smothered the other.","keys":["Similar reaction to losing the ball: 23% and 28% won back within 5 s.","15 high regains for {T:away:sub} (balls lost by the opponent in their own 35 metres): that many attacks starting next to goal."],"impact":"Pressing did not decide it: look elsewhere, in the boxes."}},"s4":{"fr":{"lead":"Deux équipes proches sur l'axe (+0,56 et +0,24) : pas de choc de styles, plutôt un duel de mêmes recettes.","keys":["Le carrefour du réseau {T:home:de} : Paul Pogba, impliqué dans 94 passes entre titulaires.","Le carrefour du réseau {T:away:de} : Luis Advíncula, impliqué dans 89 passes entre titulaires."],"impact":"À style égal, c'est l'exécution qui tranche : avantage {T:home:bare}."},"en":{"lead":"Two teams close on the axis (+0.56 and +0.24): no clash of styles, more of a mirror match.","keys":["The hub of {T:home:pos} network: Paul Pogba, involved in 94 passes between starters.","The hub of {T:away:pos} network: Luis Advíncula, involved in 89 passes between starters."],"impact":"With similar styles, execution decides: advantage {T:home:sub}."}},"s5":{"fr":{"lead":"Perdre le ballon coûtait plus cher à {T:away:sub} : 4 tirs adverses en transition (1,31 xG), contre 8 pour l'autre camp.","keys":["But encaissé en transition par {T:away:sub} : 34'. Le repli arrivait en retard.","Sans 360, on ne voit pas les courses de repli : seuls les tirs concédés racontent l'histoire."],"impact":"Le match s'est en partie joué là : mieux gérer ses pertes, c'est souvent mieux gérer le score."},"en":{"lead":"Losing the ball cost {T:away:sub} more: 4 opponent shots in transition (1.31 xG), against 8 the other way.","keys":["Goal conceded in transition by {T:away:sub}: 34'. The recovery run came too late.","Without 360, recovery runs are invisible: only the shots conceded tell the story."],"impact":"Part of the match was decided right there: managing your losses is often managing the scoreline."}},"s6":{"fr":{"lead":"Sans 360, on mesure l'attention reçue : André Carrillo a subi 4,18 actions défensives de plus que la normale pour 10 touches.","keys":["Olivier Giroud ({T:home:bare}) : +3,73.","Jefferson Farfán ({T:away:bare}) : +2,98.","Luis Advíncula ({T:away:bare}) : +2,84.","À l'autre bout, Raphaël Varane (−1,78) a joué dans un relatif anonymat : parfois, c'est exactement ce qu'on cherche."],"impact":"André Carrillo a aspiré la défense, sans que personne n'en profite : de la gravité sans satellite."},"en":{"lead":"Without 360, we measure attention received: André Carrillo drew 4.18 more defensive actions than normal per 10 touches.","keys":["Olivier Giroud ({T:home:sub}): +3.73.","Jefferson Farfán ({T:away:sub}): +2.98.","Luis Advíncula ({T:away:sub}): +2.84.","At the other end, Raphaël Varane (−1.78) played in relative peace: sometimes that is exactly the point."],"impact":"André Carrillo pulled the defence in, but nobody cashed in: gravity without a satellite."}},"s7":{"fr":{"lead":"Menace créée balle au pied et à la passe (xT) : 1,31 pour {T:home:sub}, 1,05 pour {T:away:sub}. Le meilleur créateur : Paul Pogba, 0,37 xT à lui seul (29 % de la menace de son équipe).","keys":["Geste le plus menaçant {T:home:de} : une passe signée Paul Pogba à la 33e minute (+0,14 xT), juste avant un but.","Geste le plus menaçant {T:away:de} : une passe signée André Carrillo à la 74e minute (+0,08 xT)."],"impact":"La menace a payé : {T:home:sub} a fait avancer le ballon plus dangereusement, et le score a suivi."},"en":{"lead":"Threat created by passes and carries (xT): 1.31 for {T:home:sub}, 1.05 for {T:away:sub}. Top creator: Paul Pogba, 0.37 xT on his own (29% of his team's threat).","keys":["{T:home:pos} most dangerous action: a pass by Paul Pogba in minute 33 (+0.14 xT), just before a goal.","{T:away:pos} most dangerous action: a pass by André Carrillo in minute 74 (+0.08 xT)."],"impact":"Threat paid off: {T:home:sub} moved the ball more dangerously, and the score followed."}},"s8":{"fr":{"lead":"Sur l'ensemble de la compétition, Miguel Trauco pointe au 5e rang des latéraux (sur 88). Ce match, c'était aussi une vitrine.","keys":["Paul Pogba ({T:home:bare}) : 9e des milieux sur 123.","Luis Advíncula ({T:away:bare}) : 13e des latéraux sur 88.","Kylian Mbappé ({T:home:bare}) : 11e des attaquants sur 68.","Joueurs dans le top 5 de leur poste : 0 pour {T:home:sub}, 1 pour {T:away:sub}."],"impact":"Le collectif a battu les individualités : {T:home:sub} gagne avec moins de joueurs au sommet des classements."},"en":{"lead":"Across the whole competition, Miguel Trauco ranks 5th among full-backs (out of 88). This match was also a showcase.","keys":["Paul Pogba ({T:home:sub}): 9th of 123 midfielders.","Luis Advíncula ({T:away:sub}): 13th of 88 full-backs.","Kylian Mbappé ({T:home:sub}): 11th of 68 forwards.","Players in their position's top 5: 0 for {T:home:sub}, 1 for {T:away:sub}."],"impact":"The collective beat the individuals: {T:home:sub} won with fewer players at the top of the rankings."}},"s9":{"fr":{"lead":"Jumeau statistique pour Kylian Mbappé : Raheem Sterling ({TN:England}, Euro 2020), similaire à 90 %. Mêmes habitudes, autre maillot.","keys":["Pedro Gallese ↔ David Ospina (Coupe du monde 2018, 98 %).","Olivier Giroud ↔ O. Giroud (Euro 2016, 98 %).","Paolo Guerrero ↔ Robert Lewandowski (Euro 2020, 98 %)."],"impact":"Un jumeau n'est pas un clone : la similarité compare des profils par 90 minutes (tirs, passes, xT, défense…), pas le talent. Mais ça donne des idées au mercato."},"en":{"lead":"Kylian Mbappé's statistical twin? Raheem Sterling ({TN:England}, Euro 2020), 90% similar. Same habits, different shirt.","keys":["Pedro Gallese ↔ David Ospina (2018 World Cup, 98%).","Olivier Giroud ↔ O. Giroud (Euro 2016, 98%).","Paolo Guerrero ↔ Robert Lewandowski (Euro 2020, 98%)."],"impact":"A twin is not a clone: similarity compares per-90 profiles (shots, passes, xT, defending…), not talent. Still, it gives transfer ideas."}}}}